'''Idi:Ne''' (イディ:Ne, ''Idi:Ne'') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemy found in the [[The Face of God/Invasion|The Face of God Invasion]] which appears in after clearing [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|Eldritch Forces Invasion]] and all [[Uncanny Legends]] sub-chapters on 1-Crown difficulty. After completing the stage, [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N]]'s [[True Form]] can be unlocked. She was added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Idi:Ne
|image = E 700.png
|first appearance = '''UL:''' [[The Face of God/Invasion|Sub-chapter 36 - The Face of God Invasion]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
Compared to [[Idi:Re]], this enemy is immune to [[Wave Attack|Waves]] and [[Surge Attack|Surges]], but is otherwise much weaker, with only 1/6 as much health, 1/2 the attack power, fewer knockbacks and no Strengthen ability. However, in her only appearance, she is spammed, creating essentially an army of up to 27 Idi:Nes. Thankfully, the enemy limit in her stage is only 10, so you don't have to fight all of them at once.

The Face of God Invasion also has a [[Base Barrier]] which renders the enemy base invulnerable until the boss is defeated, but the boss just so happens to be the first Idi:Ne in the stage, making it possible to rush her and the base down before the bulk of her copies approach.

